CORE
main.sh
--shell-strings refined
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
The arms of case are blocks of their own, so that the jumps to them skip
no declarations of temporaries: goto_convert would implement those with
__CPROVER_going_to flags, whose merges made the pointers of the strings
exponentially large trees, which took the string solver over 200 seconds
and 4 GB for these six arms.
